1	//! Tests for spell fizzle behavior (rule 608.2b/c).
2	//!
3	//! When a spell's targets all become illegal before resolution, it should
4	//! be countered by game rules ("fizzle"). These tests document the expected
5	//! behavior and verify what currently happens.
6	//!
7	//! Also tests multi-target spell behavior: partial target illegality should
8	//! still allow the spell to resolve for remaining legal targets (608.2c).
9	
10	mod common;
11	
